<Slide style={{ padding: 60, background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 600 }}>
        <Box style={{ height: 20, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', letterSpacing: 2 }}>03 · 为什么放心</Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 4, borderRadius: 2, background: '#2563EB' }} />
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B', marginTop: 16, lineHeight: 1.2 }}>
            数据主权：数据不出内网，开关握在自己手里
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#E2E8F0', marginTop: 16 }} />

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 32 }}>
            {/* 左：盾形 SVG */}
            <Box style={{ width: 380, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <svg width={320} height={340} viewBox='0 0 320 340'>
                    <path d='M160 20 L290 70 L290 170 C290 250 230 300 160 320 C90 300 30 250 30 170 L30 70 Z' fill='#E8EEFB' stroke='#2563EB' strokeWidth='3' />
                    <path d='M160 60 L250 95 L250 168 C250 228 208 266 160 282 C112 266 70 228 70 168 L70 95 Z' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#C7D6F5' strokeWidth='2' />
                    <rect x='118' y='150' width='84' height='64' rx='8' fill='#2563EB' />
                    <path d='M134 150 L134 134 C134 116 146 104 160 104 C174 104 186 116 186 134 L186 150' fill='none' stroke='#2563EB' strokeWidth='10' />
                    <circle cx='160' cy='178' r='9' fill='#FFFFFF' />
                    <rect x='156' y='178' width='8' height='18' fill='#FFFFFF' />
                    <text x='160' y='252' textAnchor='middle' fontSize='17' fill='#1E293B' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei' fontWeight='bold'>数据留在自己机器上</text>
                </svg>
            </Box>

            {/* 右：四行 */}
            <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                <Box style={{ height: 100, borderBottomWidth: 1, borderBottomColor: '#E2E8F0', borderBottomStyle: 'solid' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: '600', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.3, marginTop: 4 }}>本地部署，数据自持</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>
                        一台服务器跑起来，配置、会话、文档、记忆全部落在公司自己的机器上。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ height: 100, borderBottomWidth: 1, borderBottomColor: '#E2E8F0', borderBottomStyle: 'solid' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: '600', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.3, marginTop: 4 }}>脱敏策略自己定</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>
                        输入输出可配置阻断、删除、掩码、哈希四种脱敏策略，按数据敏感度选择。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ height: 100, borderBottomWidth: 1, borderBottomColor: '#E2E8F0', borderBottomStyle: 'solid' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: '600', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.3, marginTop: 4 }}>权限隔离，运维留痕</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>
                        数据按人隔离，员工只见自己的资源；管理员跨用户运维同样留痕可查。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ height: 100 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: '600', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.3, marginTop: 4 }}>敏感场景可完全离线</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>
                        支持本地模型与本地向量化：内网推理、内网检索，不出网也能用起来。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        {/* 结论条 */}
        <Box style={{ height: 58, background: '#FFF7E9', borderRadius: 10, padding: 14, marginTop: 10, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: '600', color: '#7C2D12', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
                该上云的环节仍可上云，该留内网的必须留得住——选择权在配置里，不在合同里。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
